From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Raine Makelainen <raine.makelainen@jolla.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2020 15:24:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 27/67] Introduce EmbedInitGlue to the mozglue. JB#50788

Signed-off-by: Raine Makelainen <raine.makelainen@jolla.com>
Signed-off-by: Pavel Tumakaev <p.tumakaev@omprussia.ru>

[sailfishos][gecko] Update GetBoostrap return value

The return value has changed from Bootstrap::UniquePtr to
BootstrapResult in line with Rust Result values. See D104263:

https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D104263#change-j67rRDJpo4Q7

https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1690384

Co-authored-by: David Llewellyn-Jones <david@flypig.co.uk>
---
 mozglue/moz.build  | 3 +++
 mozglue/sailfishos | 1 +
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)
 create mode 120000 mozglue/sailfishos

diff --git a/mozglue/moz.build b/mozglue/moz.build
index 4ef610890b2f8..0cdfecbc8a6c7 100644
--- a/mozglue/moz.build
+++ b/mozglue/moz.build
@@ -16,6 +16,9 @@ if CONFIG["MOZ_WIDGET_TOOLKIT"] == "android":
 if CONFIG["OS_ARCH"] == "Linux" and not CONFIG["FUZZING_SNAPSHOT"]:
     DIRS += ["interposers"]
 
+if CONFIG["MOZ_WIDGET_TOOLKIT"] == "qt":
+    DIRS += ["sailfishos"]
+
 DIRS += [
     "baseprofiler",
     "build",
diff --git a/mozglue/sailfishos b/mozglue/sailfishos
new file mode 120000
index 0000000000000..248a49b4812fd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/mozglue/sailfishos
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../mozglue/sailfishos
\ No newline at end of file
